{
 "id": "suffix-adj",
 "part": "Γ",
 "el": "Επίθετα και επιρρήματα",
 "title": "Suffixes for adjectives and adverbs",
 "level": "A2–C1",
 "intro": [
  {
   "p": "Adjective suffixes say what kind of link the adjective makes: *related to* (-ικός), *of a time or material* (-ινός / -ινος), *able to be* (-ιμος, -τός), *full of* (-ερός, -ώδης), *too much of* (-ιάρης). Adverbs come from adjectives in **-α** (everyday) or **-ως** (learned)."
  }
 ],
